# Strict retrieval policy

Use Context Engine MCP (`context-engine`) as the ONLY retrieval source (use `map` / `focus` / `status()` as needed).

Do not use native Grep/Glob/rg/find/SemanticSearch/codebase_search/Task/explore for retrieval.

Only if `context-engine` MCP is unavailable (connection/runtime failure or unhealthy `status()`), allow a single native locate pass (e.g. Grep/Glob) to get the exact file/lines you must edit, then immediately switch back to editing.
